WEBVTT

00:21.760 --> 00:23.560
What is a human's

00:24.040 --> 00:25.040
greatest driving force?

00:28.520 --> 00:29.880
Strength?

00:29.960 --> 00:33.720
-Go, O!
-Go, O!

00:33.800 --> 00:35.480
Good looks?

00:52.040 --> 00:53.360
Talent?

01:00.640 --> 01:02.720
-Nice one, buddy.
-Hey!

01:02.800 --> 01:05.200
-That was awesome.
-It hurts.

01:05.280 --> 01:07.400
GREEN 1
ORANGE 0

01:07.480 --> 01:08.680
Victory?

01:10.200 --> 01:11.840
I'm getting tired just by standing.

01:12.360 --> 01:13.240
Fuck, man.

01:17.800 --> 01:18.640
Hey, O.

01:20.880 --> 01:21.880
Love?

01:22.440 --> 01:23.280
Hey, Bam.

01:23.360 --> 01:25.560
Why did you only give O one?
What about us?

01:25.640 --> 01:26.760
Yours are over there.

01:28.160 --> 01:29.320
O, here's your energy drink.

01:29.760 --> 01:31.320
We only get plain water.

01:31.760 --> 01:34.600
What kind of manager are you?
You're so biased.

01:34.680 --> 01:35.720
I'm not.

01:36.320 --> 01:39.160
It's only because he deserves it.

01:39.240 --> 01:40.840
You didn't score one goal today, Teng.

01:40.920 --> 01:42.280
-Hey!
-Bam?

01:42.360 --> 01:44.120
-What?
-I'm the goalkeeper.

01:44.520 --> 01:45.680
How do you expect me to score?

01:46.400 --> 01:50.600
And, Bam, I scored one last time,
and you didn't give me anything.

01:51.400 --> 01:53.120
Really? I must have forgotten.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.240
What?

01:54.760 --> 01:56.200
-Hey, O.
-She never gives us anything.

01:56.280 --> 01:58.000
Can we go out for ice cream later?

01:58.080 --> 01:59.920
My treat, to celebrate your victory.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.320
Please?

02:01.400 --> 02:02.800
I'm sorry, Bam.

02:02.880 --> 02:04.760
I have to meet up with my mom today.

02:06.360 --> 02:07.360
That's fine.

02:08.199 --> 02:10.199
Will you please tell her I said hi?

02:10.880 --> 02:12.080
Of course.

02:13.400 --> 02:14.720
Thank you.

02:14.800 --> 02:16.040
Mommy's boy.

02:16.560 --> 02:17.760
-Hey, Por.
-Yes?

02:17.840 --> 02:18.840
I love my mom, too.

02:18.920 --> 02:19.880
How nosey.

02:23.680 --> 02:26.920
Por, when do you think Mr. Vinai
is bringing in the new manager?

02:27.000 --> 02:29.200
-There's a new one?
-Yes.

02:29.280 --> 02:32.400
They say the new one is superb,
and doesn't have favorites.

02:33.080 --> 02:35.360
I don't think we need a superb one.

02:35.440 --> 02:37.200
Just a regular one

02:37.640 --> 02:38.840
would still be better than Bam.

02:40.320 --> 02:42.400
They should hurry up.
I'm sick and tired of her.

02:42.480 --> 02:44.920
-That's true.
-Are you talking about me?

03:12.880 --> 03:13.840
Hey, guys.

03:14.280 --> 03:15.560
Here's the new manager.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.840
-Hello.
-Hello.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.480
I'm Nanno.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.440
Right.

03:20.520 --> 03:25.200
Bam, take care of Nanno. She's new.
She's in the same year as you.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.320
I'm in a different class.

03:29.600 --> 03:30.600
Sir.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.480
If you keep staring,
your eyes will drop out.

03:33.160 --> 03:35.320
-How was the game?
-Good. We are doing well.

03:41.040 --> 03:44.680
A human's greatest driving force…

03:49.600 --> 03:51.200
is hatred.

05:05.640 --> 05:06.480
Hey.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.760
-What?
-What's wrong?

05:08.840 --> 05:10.440
-Nanno, dear.
-Yes?

05:10.520 --> 05:14.840
I heard that you were the manager
of your previous school's team.

05:14.920 --> 05:15.880
That's right.

05:17.040 --> 05:19.040
What kind of manager are you?

05:19.120 --> 05:21.080
The scary, encouragement-shouting kind,

05:21.160 --> 05:22.840
or the loving, caring kind?

05:22.920 --> 05:24.720
I'm fine with anything,

05:25.200 --> 05:26.560
as long as she's unbiased.

05:26.640 --> 05:27.600
Teng.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.000
Do you want to fucking go?

05:29.080 --> 05:30.640
I'm really imposing.

05:30.720 --> 05:32.880
It's my first day
and you're paying for my meal.

05:32.960 --> 05:34.920
I should be the one who pays for yours.

05:35.000 --> 05:37.120
It's our duty. It's…

05:37.760 --> 05:40.080
We just want to give you
a warm welcome, okay?

05:40.160 --> 05:42.720
-O, we have to welcome her, right?
-Right.

05:43.320 --> 05:45.560
What time are you going to meet your mom?

05:46.120 --> 05:48.720
What mom? I don't have one.
Teng doesn't have one, too.

05:50.760 --> 05:52.440
-Here's your ice cream, Nanno.
-Thank you.

05:53.640 --> 05:56.200
-It has jelly, too.
-I chose it myself.

05:58.840 --> 06:00.240
Is it good, Nanno?

06:00.320 --> 06:01.320
It is.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.800
O, pass it here.

06:15.880 --> 06:17.360
Pass it to me.

06:17.440 --> 06:19.200
Keep it up, everyone!

06:23.920 --> 06:25.080
Hey, O!

06:25.560 --> 06:26.520
O, pass it.

06:26.600 --> 06:27.880
Go on!

06:27.960 --> 06:29.080
Pass it to me.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.240
-Hey!
-Hey!

06:30.320 --> 06:31.800
Go, go!

06:38.560 --> 06:39.560
Yes!

06:48.200 --> 06:50.360
When you're done with the balls,
go and pick up the cups.

06:50.440 --> 06:51.320
Sure.

06:57.440 --> 06:59.400
And don't forget the towels over there.

07:00.720 --> 07:01.840
Hurry up.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.640
Okay, no problem.

07:10.760 --> 07:12.640
And the basket over there.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.320
Can you carry that by yourself?

07:16.400 --> 07:17.400
Yes.

07:18.600 --> 07:21.600
Bam, she's just arrived,
and you're being so hard on her.

07:22.600 --> 07:24.920
Well, I have to train her.

07:26.920 --> 07:28.320
Here, let me help.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.280
The hallway to the storeroom is dark.

07:31.360 --> 07:33.040
-The light bulb has gone out.
-Thank you.

07:33.840 --> 07:35.480
-Hey, O.
-Oh, my gosh.

07:35.560 --> 07:36.400
Here you go.

07:40.360 --> 07:42.200
Let me take it.

07:42.280 --> 07:44.120
That's okay. It's not far.

07:44.640 --> 07:45.920
Thank you.

08:04.760 --> 08:07.640
I'M BORED

08:32.000 --> 08:38.400
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

09:12.120 --> 09:15.400
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

09:55.200 --> 09:56.400
LOVE KICK

09:56.480 --> 09:58.600
EP 1: THE BEGINNING
BY BAMOH

10:01.120 --> 10:02.320
COMMENTS

10:02.400 --> 10:03.920
THIS IS SUPER FUN. SUBSCRIBED.

10:04.000 --> 10:06.360
LOVE IT. WHEN'S THE NEXT EPISODE?

10:06.440 --> 10:07.800
MY HEART'S POUNDING. I'M BLUSHING.

10:33.720 --> 10:34.720
What do you want?

10:35.880 --> 10:36.800
Nothing.

10:36.880 --> 10:38.000
Can't I have a look?

10:38.080 --> 10:39.200
You're so nosey.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.640
Why do you still write it down
before you type it?

10:43.120 --> 10:44.520
Are you a Neanderthal?

10:45.200 --> 10:46.960
Neanderthals didn't have paper.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.960
You always argue with me.

10:49.040 --> 10:52.640
Anyway, the episode you posted last week

10:53.560 --> 10:55.040
got a lot of compliments.

10:55.400 --> 10:58.280
There's one comment that I really like.

10:59.240 --> 11:01.120
It says…

11:02.080 --> 11:03.520
"Blah, blah, blah."

11:03.600 --> 11:04.600
Stop it.

11:04.680 --> 11:06.600
Why? Does it hurt?

11:18.720 --> 11:21.720
I'M IN EUPHORIA. I LOVE IT. WRITE MORE.

11:21.800 --> 11:24.960
"THE VOICE THAT UNDID HER." AWESOME.

11:49.280 --> 11:52.440
Today, O scored a goal. He's so good.

11:52.520 --> 11:54.440
He's so talented and kind.

11:54.520 --> 11:56.160
He's such a cutie.

11:57.040 --> 11:58.760
When he turned to look at his fans,

11:58.840 --> 12:00.560
my palms were sweating.

12:01.240 --> 12:03.120
But then a new girl arrived.

12:03.800 --> 12:05.400
Her name is Nanno.

12:05.480 --> 12:07.000
What an irritating bitch.

12:07.640 --> 12:10.120
She's going to be my co-manager.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.280
What an annoying chatterbox.

12:12.840 --> 12:14.680
So, I wrote shit about her
on the bathroom wall,

12:14.760 --> 12:15.960
and she saw it.

12:16.480 --> 12:17.680
That was satisfying.

12:18.880 --> 12:21.000
I hope she transfers soon.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.320
I can't stand her.

12:22.400 --> 12:23.640
She acts like she's so pretty.

12:24.120 --> 12:26.400
Teng and Por kept staring at her.

12:26.920 --> 12:28.640
Go and fuck them both, will you?

12:45.680 --> 12:49.600
BAM, THANKS SO MUCH FOR THE TOWEL.

12:49.680 --> 12:51.120
PLEASE HELP NANNO SETTLE IN.

12:51.200 --> 12:53.880
SHE TOLD ME SHE WANTS TO LEARN.
TAKE CARE OF HER.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.920
Hey, you dropped one.

13:14.600 --> 13:15.600
Oh, no.

13:16.480 --> 13:17.680
Oh, my.

13:22.080 --> 13:23.800
Go and wash them right now.

13:24.440 --> 13:25.440
They really stink.

13:25.840 --> 13:26.920
Of course.

13:34.480 --> 13:35.480
Come here.

13:36.040 --> 13:37.080
I'll help.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.520
-Hey, O.
-Hey.

13:38.600 --> 13:39.440
Hey.

13:40.640 --> 13:42.160
Thank you so much, Bam.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.680
They are clean.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.640
-Hey, Por.
-What?

14:30.720 --> 14:32.320
Help the defender after passing the ball.

14:32.400 --> 14:34.040
I'm a winger. I have to be at the front.

14:34.120 --> 14:36.160
The goalkeeper and I
can't take them all by ourselves.

14:36.240 --> 14:38.360
-Tell the other defenders.
-Just listen to me next time.

14:38.840 --> 14:39.920
What the hell?

14:40.880 --> 14:44.080
Bam, did you take a shit in here?
Why does it stink so bad?

14:44.160 --> 14:45.520
Screw you. It's not me.

14:46.680 --> 14:48.200
Are you saying that Nanno farted?

14:48.760 --> 14:50.480
No, I didn't.

14:50.560 --> 14:51.640
See?

14:51.720 --> 14:54.080
Nanno would never do something like that.

14:54.160 --> 14:55.240
Bam.

14:55.880 --> 14:57.600
You're jealous
because she just transferred

14:57.680 --> 14:59.560
and we already prefer her over you, right?

15:00.480 --> 15:02.120
You're like the evil stepmother.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.720
Think what you want.

15:05.800 --> 15:07.000
Hey, O.

15:07.080 --> 15:08.760
Nanno, can I have some water?

15:08.840 --> 15:09.920
Sure.

15:10.000 --> 15:13.200
Bring the water and let's get out of here
before we reek of shit.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.600
Here, O.

15:20.880 --> 15:22.360
-Nanno.
-Yes?

15:22.440 --> 15:23.560
You'll have to excuse me.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.200
Why?

15:30.160 --> 15:33.360
Bam, what's wrong with everybody?

15:33.440 --> 15:34.840
Tell me, Bam.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.360
Everyone!

15:54.600 --> 15:55.880
The stench…

15:57.520 --> 15:58.440
Is it…

15:58.920 --> 16:00.880
coming from my face?

16:08.080 --> 16:09.680
I'm so sorry.

16:14.800 --> 16:18.360
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

16:46.920 --> 16:48.640
I think you should try something.

16:49.440 --> 16:50.320
Bam?

16:50.400 --> 16:52.720
Cosmetics, face wash, perfume.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.320
There are a lot to choose from.

16:55.760 --> 16:57.280
It might stop your face from stinking.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.080
Quickly.

17:03.120 --> 17:05.119
But I don't know which one to choose.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.680
I could just buy everything.

17:17.760 --> 17:18.960
Would you like some, too?

17:37.200 --> 17:44.200
O LOVES BAM VERY MUCH

17:48.680 --> 17:49.800
Please let this be.

18:01.520 --> 18:03.160
O, SATTAWAT PHUPHA

18:03.240 --> 18:05.280
GRADE 12 CLASS 2
FOOTBALL PLAYER NO. 7

18:13.160 --> 18:15.080
BAM, WIPHADA CHEUNCHOM

18:15.160 --> 18:17.440
GRADE 10 CLASS 3
FOOTBALL TEAM MANAGER

18:37.120 --> 18:39.280
Bam, someone's here to see you.

18:39.360 --> 18:41.160
Who? Is it O?

18:41.240 --> 18:42.480
It's Mr. Vinai.

18:51.680 --> 18:52.760
Bam.

18:52.840 --> 18:54.040
-Bam?
-Yes?

18:54.720 --> 18:57.080
How's the new manager?
Is she doing a good job?

18:57.160 --> 18:58.440
She's okay.

18:58.520 --> 19:00.520
Good. At first, I thought
you wouldn't get along.

19:00.600 --> 19:02.360
But if she can help, it's fine by me.

19:02.440 --> 19:03.280
Right.

19:04.320 --> 19:05.520
And, Bam.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.120
-Bam.
-Yes?

19:07.680 --> 19:09.640
Please be more careful with food.

19:09.720 --> 19:11.640
I heard you all got sick this morning.

19:12.200 --> 19:13.240
What did you eat?

19:13.760 --> 19:14.680
Pass it here.

19:14.760 --> 19:15.760
I don't know.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.440
Well, take care of it.

19:17.960 --> 19:19.600
-That's it.
-I'm not going in to get it.

19:19.680 --> 19:21.240
Not so hard, you'll hit somebody.

19:33.840 --> 19:36.120
Are you all right?

19:37.080 --> 19:39.560
I'm fine.

19:48.080 --> 19:49.920
I wasn't asking you. I was asking him.

19:51.320 --> 19:52.960
I'm all right. Thanks, O.

19:53.960 --> 19:56.920
Teng, be careful.
Watch where you're kicking the ball.

19:57.000 --> 19:59.040
If it hits anyone,
it not just you that gets scolded.

19:59.120 --> 20:00.560
Both of us will get it.

20:00.640 --> 20:02.520
-Come and apologize, now.
-You idiot, Teng.

20:02.600 --> 20:04.640
-What an idiot.
-I'm sorry, Sir.

20:06.080 --> 20:08.160
-Haven't you had enough practice?
-We have, sir.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.360
Do you want to stay for more?

20:09.440 --> 20:11.080
-No thanks, sir.
-Just a bit more, for fun.

20:11.160 --> 20:13.280
-We were just having fun.
-Just playing around.

20:13.360 --> 20:14.880
Let me walk you to the staff room, sir.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.160
-Fine.
-Let's go.

20:21.160 --> 20:22.000
Hey, Bam.

20:22.600 --> 20:23.960
You didn't get hit, right?

20:24.040 --> 20:25.560
-Why?
-Your nose.

20:29.520 --> 20:30.600
Hey.

20:30.680 --> 20:33.080
Don't tell me you thought
O was protecting you.

20:33.520 --> 20:36.040
I see. Your heart is beating so hard

20:36.120 --> 20:38.480
and you got a nosebleed
just because a guy got close to you.

20:40.200 --> 20:41.480
How is that even possible, Bam?

20:41.840 --> 20:43.440
Who the hell would want to protect you?

20:44.320 --> 20:45.200
Let me be blunt.

20:45.280 --> 20:47.600
If a ball was going to hit
either you or a dog,

20:47.720 --> 20:49.720
I would jump right in front of the dog.

20:50.320 --> 20:51.720
Don't give me that look.

20:52.280 --> 20:53.840
It really doesn't suit you.

20:53.920 --> 20:56.480
Usually, I would say it's cute
when a girl gives a sideways glance.

20:56.560 --> 20:58.840
But on your face, I think it's horrible.

20:59.640 --> 21:01.360
-Teng.
-What?

21:04.520 --> 21:05.520
What?

21:06.320 --> 21:08.800
Is your heart pounding for me, too, Bam?

21:09.320 --> 21:10.320
Hey.

21:11.080 --> 21:12.640
I must have gotten more handsome lately.

21:23.680 --> 21:27.800
TENG IS A DOG

21:38.680 --> 21:40.840
-Hey, Teng.
-Teng, what the fuck is wrong?

21:41.920 --> 21:43.840
-Teng, what's wrong?
-He has lost his mind.

21:43.920 --> 21:45.560
What the hell?

21:45.640 --> 21:47.560
Teng, stop it.

21:47.640 --> 21:49.200
Teng, snap out of it.

21:49.280 --> 21:50.440
What the fuck?

21:51.000 --> 21:51.960
Hey.

21:52.040 --> 21:53.520
Snap out of it!

21:59.960 --> 22:02.240
What are you doing?
You are here to practice.

22:02.320 --> 22:04.480
-Something's wrong with him.
-Something happened to Teng.

22:04.560 --> 22:05.520
What's wrong?

22:05.600 --> 22:07.400
Hey, hey!

22:08.520 --> 22:09.640
Get him!

22:10.360 --> 22:11.680
What the fuck is wrong with you?

22:12.760 --> 22:14.240
Get it together, Teng.

22:14.320 --> 22:16.400
-Teng.
-Teng.

22:17.560 --> 22:18.720
Teng.

22:18.800 --> 22:19.920
They said he's like a dog.

22:20.000 --> 22:21.400
-Please take care of him.
-Of course.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.480
Take care of him.

22:32.880 --> 22:35.480
Bam, what's wrong with Teng?

22:36.200 --> 22:38.120
Why is he acting like a dog?

22:38.760 --> 22:41.200
Is he going to recover in time
for the national competition?

22:41.960 --> 22:43.400
Don't worry, Nanno.

22:44.680 --> 22:45.760
I'm sorry.

23:37.480 --> 23:44.480
NANNO IS A DOG

24:08.240 --> 24:09.960
You can put away your plate, Bam.

24:10.360 --> 24:11.440
No, I'm staying here.

24:35.880 --> 24:42.840
O LOVES BAM VERY MUCH

24:48.440 --> 24:49.480
What are you doing?

24:51.080 --> 24:52.400
Nothing, I'm testing my pens.

24:52.480 --> 24:54.560
Right. That's some serious testing.

24:54.640 --> 24:56.280
You're testing every single one.

24:57.000 --> 24:59.720
How about some serious tidying,
washing up, and sweeping?

25:00.840 --> 25:02.080
No way.

25:06.640 --> 25:08.440
You've got it bad.

25:09.160 --> 25:10.200
Let me have a look.

25:10.280 --> 25:11.200
Hey.

25:11.560 --> 25:14.640
I thought you were doing calligraphy.
Are you putting spells on people?

25:15.560 --> 25:16.800
That's my business.

25:24.480 --> 25:25.840
BAM, CAN WE TALK?

25:31.840 --> 25:33.400
OF COURSE.

25:35.000 --> 25:38.280
I HAVE SOMETHING TO ASK YOU.

25:42.240 --> 25:45.320
ABOUT WHAT?

25:51.800 --> 25:58.280
WILL YOU BE MY GIRLFRIEND?

26:02.560 --> 26:05.400
IT'S ABOUT NANNO.

26:45.760 --> 26:48.800
If only the things I write in my diary
came true like the writing on the wall,

26:49.480 --> 26:52.000
I'll be the female version of Light,
a character from Death Note.

26:53.080 --> 26:55.400
I'll write the names of all the jerks
and get rid of them.

27:08.880 --> 27:10.000
Hello, Mom?

27:10.440 --> 27:11.840
I'm going to stop by.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.920
I'm going to help your sister
pack up and move.

27:15.200 --> 27:16.280
Okay.

27:16.800 --> 27:19.360
Mom, she never said anything about moving.

27:19.760 --> 27:22.640
What? She told me months ago.

27:22.720 --> 27:24.080
I thought she would have told you.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.360
Really?

27:25.440 --> 27:26.320
Whatever.

27:26.760 --> 27:29.120
Where are your manners?
Don't talk to me like that.

27:29.560 --> 27:30.720
I'm sorry.

27:32.000 --> 27:34.320
I'm going to bed, Mom. I'm tired.

27:35.160 --> 27:36.400
I'll see you tomorrow.

27:53.160 --> 27:55.880
NANNO, YOU STINKFACE BITCH

27:55.960 --> 27:58.120
TENG IS A DOG

28:05.280 --> 28:06.560
Come here, bitch.

28:08.760 --> 28:13.160
This is for giving us
the wrong answers to the homework.

28:15.080 --> 28:18.400
And this one is for doing Poj's homework.

28:19.520 --> 28:21.440
He got the right answers,

28:21.520 --> 28:23.760
but you gave us bullshit.

28:23.840 --> 28:25.920
Poj paid me. You didn't.

28:26.000 --> 28:27.440
Do you want some payment? Here.

28:27.520 --> 28:28.520
No.

28:28.600 --> 28:31.520
Next time, don't be a such a smart-ass.

28:31.880 --> 28:34.640
If one word of my homework
is different from yours,

28:34.720 --> 28:36.080
what you'll get is worse than this.

29:06.320 --> 29:07.760
I saw everything.

29:18.280 --> 29:19.280
Hey.

29:20.960 --> 29:22.680
If you really hate someone,

29:24.120 --> 29:25.720
you could try writing on the wall.

29:27.240 --> 29:29.080
I think it's a good way to let off steam.

29:32.880 --> 29:35.400
And sometimes,

29:36.000 --> 29:37.320
the things you write…

29:38.600 --> 29:40.080
come true.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.800
Like God's listening to your prayers.

29:48.200 --> 29:49.640
On the walls in here?

29:53.760 --> 29:54.600
Try it.

30:08.960 --> 30:10.200
Fine.

30:16.240 --> 30:18.600
This place is for learning,
not for catfights.

30:18.680 --> 30:19.720
Kids these days.

30:19.800 --> 30:21.800
If you have so much time,
open a book or something.

30:23.640 --> 30:24.880
You, too?

30:24.960 --> 30:27.280
It's time for class,
and you're here chitchatting.

30:27.680 --> 30:29.960
Hiding here all day,
wasting whole periods.

30:30.240 --> 30:31.360
What's wrong with these kids?

30:47.520 --> 30:48.360
Hey, O.

30:49.680 --> 30:50.600
Hey, O.

30:53.760 --> 30:54.880
Hey, O.

31:01.240 --> 31:02.240
Hey, O.

31:06.560 --> 31:07.520
Hey, O.

31:08.360 --> 31:09.400
Here you go.

31:09.480 --> 31:10.880
-The cold one is for Por.
-Thank you.

31:12.440 --> 31:15.120
Hey, you stink. Why are you even here?

31:15.200 --> 31:17.200
You made everyone sick last time.

31:18.040 --> 31:19.200
What are you talking about?

31:19.280 --> 31:20.600
She doesn't stink.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.360
See? She smells great.

31:29.360 --> 31:30.600
Are you tired?

31:31.040 --> 31:32.720
-Exhausted.
-Yes.

31:37.720 --> 31:39.040
-Hey.
-Teng.

31:39.120 --> 31:40.600
-What the hell?
-Hello there.

31:41.360 --> 31:42.640
Are you all better?

31:42.720 --> 31:44.400
Yes, I don't know what happened.

31:44.920 --> 31:46.520
You're not barking anymore, are you?

31:47.000 --> 31:49.160
-Here, have some water.
-Okay.

31:49.480 --> 31:50.400
Woof, woof.

31:50.480 --> 31:52.400
-Woof, woof.
-Woof, woof.

31:52.480 --> 31:56.440
-Do you expect me to be a dog forever?
-Don't try to bite me again today.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.720
I won't.

31:58.320 --> 31:59.160
Hey!

32:01.160 --> 32:02.680
-Teng.
-Let me lick your face.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.560
Stop it, asshole.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.560
That's enough.

32:12.800 --> 32:14.600
What are you doing?

32:14.680 --> 32:16.720
You know about it, don't you? Is that why?

32:17.280 --> 32:18.560
Don't clean it off!

32:18.640 --> 32:20.080
Did Good tell you about it?

32:20.160 --> 32:22.400
So it was you who wrote this?

32:22.480 --> 32:24.560
And who's Good? Who else has been writing?

32:24.640 --> 32:26.240
Don't act like you don't know.

32:26.320 --> 32:27.920
Why are you cleaning it off?

32:28.000 --> 32:30.200
I have to. It's my job.

32:30.560 --> 32:32.520
They pay me to clean things up.

32:32.600 --> 32:34.720
What do you expect me to do?

32:34.800 --> 32:35.720
Give that to me.

32:35.800 --> 32:37.240
Get out of here.

32:38.120 --> 32:40.440
You have to stop. Stop it.

32:41.000 --> 32:43.200
Please don't clean it off.

32:43.280 --> 32:44.840
-Stop.
-What?

32:44.920 --> 32:46.320
I'll get reprimanded if I don't.

32:47.000 --> 32:48.160
You won't.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.800
-How do you know?
-Well…

32:54.880 --> 32:55.800
Just stop.

32:56.200 --> 32:57.560
I'll tell you a secret.

32:58.880 --> 33:02.160
If you write about someone,

33:02.240 --> 33:03.880
like wishing they would
shut up, they will.

33:03.960 --> 33:06.440
The wall is enchanted.
You get what you write.

33:11.520 --> 33:13.840
I haven't told anyone except you.

33:16.840 --> 33:17.920
How does this sound?

33:18.920 --> 33:21.920
If you don't clean it,
I'll let you write something.

33:38.560 --> 33:40.720
Do you think that I would fall
for your childish rubbish

33:40.800 --> 33:41.840
just because I'm a cleaner?

33:42.280 --> 33:43.480
You can't fool me.

33:44.760 --> 33:47.320
Now I know that you wrote this.
I can tell your teacher.

33:47.400 --> 33:49.000
Is this what I get for meaning well?

33:49.080 --> 33:50.480
Meaning well, my foot!

33:50.880 --> 33:53.280
Nobody's stupid enough
to believe that nonsense.

33:53.360 --> 33:56.520
If you want to fool someone,

33:56.600 --> 33:59.760
try using what you learn in class.
Use your brain.

34:01.200 --> 34:03.040
Writings on the wall come true?

34:03.880 --> 34:05.640
Everybody would have STDs by now.

34:05.720 --> 34:08.480
Did you randomly get selected
to study here?

34:14.199 --> 34:16.360
Your parents sent you here to learn.

34:16.440 --> 34:18.239
You could try learning some manners, too.

34:40.120 --> 34:43.400
One of the students from your club,
the small, short-haired one,

34:43.480 --> 34:44.800
has no manners.

34:45.440 --> 34:48.920
She wrote all over the bathroom wall.
It's covered in ink.

34:49.000 --> 34:51.080
She also wouldn't let me clean it off.

34:51.639 --> 34:53.320
She also raised her voice to me.

34:53.400 --> 34:55.520
I'll make sure
she is dealt with accordingly.

35:07.200 --> 35:08.160
Bam.

35:08.800 --> 35:09.800
Sir?

35:11.440 --> 35:12.920
Don't do it again.

35:15.320 --> 35:16.240
I won't.

35:16.680 --> 35:17.640
I'm sorry.

35:19.360 --> 35:21.280
I appointed you as manager

35:21.880 --> 35:23.680
because I believe
that you are a good leader.

35:24.680 --> 35:25.880
But most importantly,

35:26.280 --> 35:27.880
I trusted you.

35:29.920 --> 35:30.920
Yes, sir.

35:32.520 --> 35:33.560
Do you understand me?

35:35.600 --> 35:36.560
Yes.

35:38.560 --> 35:40.200
Go and apologize to the cleaner.

35:40.960 --> 35:42.240
She's still around.

35:44.920 --> 35:45.800
Go.

35:46.280 --> 35:47.280
Yes, sir.

37:24.720 --> 37:26.560
Writings on the wall come true?

37:27.280 --> 37:29.480
Did you randomly get selected
to study here?

37:51.520 --> 37:55.040
NOSEY CLEANER BITCH
I HOPE YOU SUFFOCATE AND DIE

37:55.960 --> 37:57.720
I saw your writing on the wall.

37:58.480 --> 38:00.680
Is it really enchanted?

39:11.160 --> 39:13.160
Subtitle translation by
Mingchut Anuwatnonthaket
